      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that's a good start. i was thinking about adding stuff like the Han dynasty in china or maybe the empires in Africa like Mali or Songhai. they had huge trade networks and really advanced systems too. do you think those belong in the 'foundations of modern global civilization' list or are they kind of separate from the main story of how we got here today?",
